<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein prices 100 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein prices 100 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager SBC Warburg, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GIROZENTRALE  </p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    28.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.451    PAY DATE   *28.NOV.96</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    99.451    SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    35 BP     UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT 2006 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
